WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.363
Retaining the virtual discussion is an option to recommend

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:07.534
Daniel may recommend keeping the virtual discussion because it

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.060
avoids new travel and service dependencies and protects the

00:00:11.099 --> 00:00:15.876
existing programme He explains those reasons to Lindiwe and

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:20.021
asks for the business decision The recommendation is not

00:00:20.047 --> 00:00:21.955
an already agreed case outcome
